  "decisions": {
    "convolution_channel_tiling": "Transferable arithmetic-preserving idea, but their Triton patch is outside the served native XPU path. Native port and separate timing needed; not a current setting.",
    "fp8_scale_transpose_elimination": "Their W8A8 activation-scale copy elimination has no equivalent hot-path allocation in our W8A16 route; activation quantization skipped, weight scales precomputed.",
